          "message": "docs(site): add registry install paths (#6540)\n\n* docs(site): add registry install paths\n\nDocument the Rust, Python, and three public npm packages alongside GitHub downloads without claiming a registry version exists. Keep the package section server-rendered and cover its links in the existing no-release E2E scenario.\n\nCo-Authored-By: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* fix(site): compose package installs through children\n\n* fix(site): make registry install cards accessible\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>",
